name \\\"glow\\\" stacked above \\\"collagen^\\\" in a prominent, elegant white serif lowercase font, directly followed by black Korean characters \\\"글로우 콜라겐\\\" and black descriptive text specifying \\\"Korean Marine Collagen Peptides with Liposomal Glutathione, Vitamin C, Resveratrol and DigeZyme®,\\\" alongside \\\"Type I & III\\\" and a white horizontal banner highlighting \\\"Tropical Bliss Flavour.\\\" To the right of this frame sits a circular graphic featuring a pink-and-white geodesic, triangular grid pattern bordered by the curved text \\\"Wild Caught • Mercury Free,\\\" with a small red \\\"Clinically Approved\\\" cross seal above it. The bottom edge of the label displays five small black line-art skin-benefit icons lined up horizontally above text indicating a net weight of 250g. When the dry powder product inside is mixed with water as directed, it dissolves to form a vibrant, translucent coral-pink beverage.\",\"referenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441847-2adc2ea9-c0cc-4150-be9b-5faab757b46b.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441997-2f98838e-1f9f-46de-becc-4cf2189a9988.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441988-f3064aac-97c7-4610-938a-4cc960c8d09d.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441892-f77f483a-80cb-4e77-a4e0-583c4fb73f17.jpg\"],\"referenceAdImageUrls\":[],\"originalReferenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441847-2adc2ea9-c0cc-4150-be9b-5faab757b46b.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441997-2f98838e-1f9f-46de-becc-4cf2189a9988.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441988-f3064aac-97c7-4610