ow the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"source\":\"campaign-creatives\",\"language\":\"English\",\"lastError\":null,\"imageModel\":\"gpt-image-2\",\"hasNSFWRisk\":false,\"imagePrompt\":\"Instructions by the director: Using the BAB (Before-After-Bridge) framework for top of funnel discovery, this static 1:1 ad appeals to the Upgrade and Optimization archetype by visualizing the superior quality of premium ingredients. The visual visual hero is a highly styled, minimalist flat-lay on a warm Sand Beige (#F4EBE1) surface, featuring the matte-white 'glow' tub surrounded by clean, artistic placements of its premium key ingredients: a branch of fresh goji berries, a sleek glass containing the vibrant, translucent coral-pink dissolved beverage, and subtle, elegant waves of clean water. The layout uses a sophisticated editorial look to expose the gap between standard supplements and this premium formulation. The short, geometric headline is set in clean Circular Std and reads: 'Upgrade your daily beauty standard.' The soft call to action sits on a sharp-edged rectangular button in Premium Black (#000000) reading 'Learn more.' Keep the ad on-brand by us