lay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"status\":\"generated\",\"createdBy\":\"f5dfb377-dac7-46a6-aea3-a4e04cb45e54\",\"metadata\":{\"brief\":\"Using the BAB (Before-After-Bridge) framework for top of funnel discovery, this static 1:1 ad appeals to the Upgrade and Optimization archetype by visualizing the superior quality of premium ingredients. The visual visual hero is a highly styled, minimalist flat-lay on a warm Sand Beige (#F4EBE1) surface, featuring the matte-white 'glow' tub surrounded by clean, artistic placements of its premium key ingredients: a branch of fresh goji berries, a sleek glass containing the vibrant, translucent coral-pink dissolved beverage, and subtle, elegant waves of clean water. The layout uses a sophisticated editorial look to expose the gap between standard supplements and this premium formulation. The short, geometric headline is set in clean Circular Std and reads: 'Upgrade your daily beauty standard.' The soft call to action sits on a sharp-edged rectangular button in Premium Black (#000000) reading 'Learn more.' Keep the ad on-brand by using the warm, organic Sand Beige background, keeping text elements under 20% of the canvas area, and emphasizing the premium, dermatologist-recommended aesthetic through airy spacing and precise, minimalist layout design.\",\"prompt\":\"Instructions by the director: Using the BAB (Before-After-Bridge) framework for top of funnel discovery, this static 1:1 ad appeals to the Upgrade and Optimization archetype by visualizing the superior quality of premium ingredients. The visual visual hero is a highly styled, minimalist flat-lay 