el, or turn any of that description into ad copy. Treat orientation-specific details carefully: show front-only details only when the product front is visible; if the brief shows the back, side, top, or an angled view where those details would not be visible, omit them instead of moving them onto the wrong face.\\n\\nThe attached product photos show the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"brandLogoUrl\":null,\"imageProvider\":\"openai\",\"productImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441847-2adc2ea9-c0cc-4150-be9b-5faab757b46b.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441997-2f98838e-1f9f-46de-becc-4cf2189a9988.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441988-f3064aac-97c7-4610-938a-4cc960c8d09d.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441892-f77f483a-80cb-4e77-a4e0-583c4fb73f17.jpg\"],\"visualDescription\":\"This dietary supplement product is packaged in a wide, cylindrical, matte-finish white plastic tub with 