            "text": "[{\"result\":{\"data\":{\"items\":[{\"id\":\"fbfd16c9-88d0-49d8-b214-e28ce83aca92\",\"orgId\":\"62f84ee9-c45f-4e41-8868-bcf0bb1ec033\",\"offeringId\":\"32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380\",\"strategyRunId\":null,\"generationJobId\":\"a7b7fd59-f5c7-4ff4-b7bf-50adfcecb925\",\"triggerRunId\":null,\"audienceNodeId\":null,\"angleNodeId\":null,\"campaignId\":\"797c4720-0a42-460f-8665-e08cff73c06d\",\"adAudienceId\":null,\"campaignAngleId\":null,\"promptRecipeId\":null,\"currentVersionId\":\"bb18343a-cd76-495b-b177-15f5304f9129\",\"storageKey\":\"campaign-creatives/797c4720-0a42-460f-8665-e08cff73c06d/3b57a867-5cfd-4754-8466-67f236469a0e.png\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/campaign-creatives/797c4720-0a42-460f-8665-e08cff73c06d/3b57a867-5cfd-4754-8466-67f236469a0e.png\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/campaign-creatives/797c4720-0a42-460f-8665-e08cff73c06d/3b57a867-5cfd-4754-8466-67f236469a0e.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"finalImagePrompt\":null,\"status\":\"generated\",\"downloadCount\":0,\"metadata\":{\"brief\":\"Using the AIDA framework to drive top of funnel discovery, this static 1:1 ad focuses on the Desire and Identity archetype by showcasing the aspirational, radiant after-state of beauty. The visual hero is a bright, airy, high-end lifestyle photograph of a person with effortlessly luminous, glowing skin, basking in warm morning sunlight and holding a clear glass of the vibrant, translucent coral-pink collagen beverage next to the elegant matte-white Wellbeing Nutrition tub. The clean layout uses a soft Wellness Cream (#fff9eb) background to evoke a premium, natural morning ritual feel. The short, high-contrast on-image headline is set in elegant Tenor Sans typography and reads: 'Drink your morning glow.' A soft call to action button is styled as a sleek, black, sharp-cornered rectangle in the bottom corner reading 'Explore the collection.' Keep this creative on-brand by using the brand's signature soft pink (#FBE7F2) accents, a light grid overlay with an opacity of 0.1 for structural sophistication, and avoiding heavy text to let the aspirational, glowing skin imagery dominate.\",\"prompt\":\"Instructions by the director: Using the AIDA framework to drive top of funnel discovery, this static 1:1 ad focuses on the Desire and Identity archetype by showcasing the aspirational, radiant after-state of beauty. The visual hero is a bright, airy, high-end lifestyle photograph of a person with effortlessly luminous, glowing skin, basking in warm morning sunlight and holding a clear glass of the vibrant, translucent coral-pink collagen beverage next to the elegant matte-white Wellbeing Nutrition tub. The clean layout uses a soft Wellness Cream (#fff9eb) background to evoke a premium, natural morning ritual feel. The short, high-contrast on-image headline is set in elegant Tenor Sans typography and reads: 'Drink your morning glow.' A soft call to action button is styled as a sleek, black, sharp-cornered rectangle in the bottom corner reading 'Explore the collection.' Keep this creative on-brand by using the brand's signature soft pink (#FBE7F2) accents, a light grid overlay with an opacity of 0.1 for structural sophistication, and avoiding heavy text to let the aspirational, glowing skin imagery dominate.\\n\\nProduct appearance: This dietary supplement product is packaged in a wide, cylindrical, matte-finish white plastic tub with a matching flat-topped, flush-fitting white screw cap. The wrap-around label features a smooth vertical color gradient, transitioning from solid white at the top to a warm, saturated coral-red at the bottom. Centered on the upper white section is a black circular logo containing the arched text \\\"WELLBEING NUTRITION\\\" surrounding a stylized central letter \\\"W\\\" with a single tiny green leaf on its top-right tip. Below the logo is a large, rectangular framed section in a deeper coral shade that houses the product name \\\"glow\\\" stacked above \\\"collagen^\\\" in a prominent, elegant white serif lowercase font, directly followed by black Korean characters \\\"글로우 콜라겐\\\" and black descriptive text specifying \\\"Korean Marine Collagen Peptides with Liposomal Glutathione, Vitamin C, Resveratrol and DigeZyme®,\\\" alongside \\\"Type I & III\\\" and a white horizontal banner highlighting \\\"Tropical Bliss Flavour.\\\" To the right of this frame sits a circular graphic featuring a pink-and-white geodesic, triangular grid pattern bordered by the curved text \\\"Wild Caught • Mercury Free,\\\" with a small red \\\"Clinically Approved\\\" cross seal above it. The bottom edge of the label displays five small black line-art skin-benefit icons lined up horizontally above text indicating a net weight of 250g. When the dry powder product inside is mixed with water as directed, it dissolves to form a vibrant, translucent coral-pink beverage.\\n\\nUse the product appearance text only as a private visual reference for accurately drawing the product. Do not print, quote, paraphrase, label, or turn any of that description into ad copy. Treat orientation-specific details carefully: show front-only details only when the product front is visible; if the brief shows the back, side, top, or an angled view where those details would not be visible, omit them instead of moving them onto the wrong face.\\n\\nThe attached product photos show the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"source\":\"campaign-creatives\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/campaign-creatives/797c4720-0a42-460f-8665-e08cff73c06d/3b57a867-5cfd-4754-8466-67f236469a0e.png\",\"language\":\"English\",\"lastError\":null,\"hasNSFWRisk\":false,\"brandLogoUrl\":null,\"imageProvider\":\"openai\",\"imageGeneratorId\":\"openai/gpt-image-2\",\"productImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441847-2adc2ea9-c0cc-4150-be9b-5faab757b46b.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441997-2f98838e-1f9f-46de-becc-4cf2189a9988.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441988-f3064aac-97c7-4610-938a-4cc960c8d09d.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441892-f77f483a-80cb-4e77-a4e0-583c4fb73f17.jpg\"],\"providerRequestId\":\"a49d4174-dc21-413b-ac7f-e2b8413cf523\",\"visualDescription\":\"This dietary supplement product is packaged in a wide, cylindrical, matte-finish white plastic tub with a matching flat-topped, flush-fitting white screw cap. The wrap-around label features a smooth vertical color gradient, transitioning from solid white at the top to a warm, saturated coral-red at the bottom. Centered on the upper white section is a black circular logo containing the arched text \\\"WELLBEING NUTRITION\\\" surrounding a stylized central letter \\\"W\\\" with a single tiny green leaf on its top-right tip. Below the logo is a large, rectangular framed section in a deeper coral shade that houses the product name \\\"glow\\\" stacked above \\\"collagen^\\\" in a prominent, elegant white serif lowercase font, directly followed by black Korean characters \\\"글로우 콜라겐\\\" and black descriptive text specifying \\\"Korean Marine Collagen Peptides with Liposomal Glutathione, Vitamin C, Resveratrol and DigeZyme®,\\\" alongside \\\"Type I & III\\\" and a white horizontal banner highlighting \\\"Tropical Bliss Flavour.\\\" To the right of this frame sits a circular graphic featuring a pink-and-white geodesic, triangular grid pattern bordered by the curved text \\\"Wild Caught • Mercury Free,\\\" with a small red \\\"Clinically Approved\\\" cross seal above it. The bottom edge of the label displays five small black line-art skin-benefit icons lined up horizontally above text indicating a net weight of 250g. When the dry powder product inside is mixed with water as directed, it dissolves to form a vibrant, translucent coral-pink beverage.\",\"moderationFallback\":null,\"referenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441847-2adc2ea9-c0cc-4150-be9b-5faab757b46b.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441997-2f98838e-1f9f-46de-becc-4cf2189a9988.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441988-f3064aac-97c7-4610-938a-4cc960c8d09d.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441892-f77f483a-80cb-4e77-a4e0-583c4fb73f17.jpg\"],\"referenceAdImageUrls\":[],\"originalReferenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441847-2adc2ea9-c0cc-4150-be9b-5faab757b46b.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441997-2f98838e-1f9f-46de-becc-4cf2189a9988.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441988-f3064aac-97c7-4610-938a-4cc960c8d09d.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441892-f77f483a-80cb-4e77-a4e0-583c4fb73f17.jpg\"],\"normalizedReferenceImageUrls\":[],\"usedNormalizedReferenceImages\":false},\"performanceLabels\":{},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-16T08:35:02.340Z\",\"versions\":[{\"id\":\"bb18343a-cd76-495b-b177-15f5304f9129\",\"creativeId\":\"fbfd16c9-88d0-49d8-b214-e28ce83aca92\",\"versionNumber\":1,\"parentVersionId\":null,\"generationJobId\":\"a7b7fd59-f5c7-4ff4-b7bf-50adfcecb925\",\"triggerRunId\":null,\"changeType\":\"initial\",\"instructions\":null,\"finalImagePrompt\":\"Instructions by the director: Using the AIDA framework to drive top of funnel discovery, this static 1:1 ad focuses on the Desire and Identity archetype by showcasing the aspirational, radiant after-state of beauty. The visual hero is a bright, airy, high-end lifestyle photograph of a person with effortlessly luminous, glowing skin, basking in warm morning sunlight and holding a clear glass of the vibrant, translucent coral-pink collagen beverage next to the elegant matte-white Wellbeing Nutrition tub. The clean layout uses a soft Wellness Cream (#fff9eb) background to evoke a premium, natural morning ritual feel. The short, high-contrast on-image headline is set in elegant Tenor Sans typography and reads: 'Drink your morning glow.' A soft call to action button is styled as a sleek, black, sharp-cornered rectangle in the bottom corner reading 'Explore the collection.' Keep this creative on-brand by using the brand's signature soft pink (#FBE7F2) accents, a light grid overlay with an opacity of 0.1 for structural sophistication, and avoiding heavy text to let the aspirational, glowing skin imagery dominate.\\n\\nProduct appearance: This dietary supplement product is packaged in a wide, cylindrical, matte-finish white plastic tub with a matching flat-topped, flush-fitting white screw cap. The wrap-around label features a smooth vertical color gradient, transitioning from solid white at the top to a warm, saturated coral-red at the bottom. Centered on the upper white section is a black circular logo containing the arched text \\\"WELLBEING NUTRITION\\\" surrounding a stylized central letter \\\"W\\\" with a single tiny green leaf on its top-right tip. Below the logo is a large, rectangular framed section in a deeper coral shade that houses the product name \\\"glow\\\" stacked above \\\"collagen^\\\" in a prominent, elegant white serif lowercase font, directly followed by black Korean characters \\\"글로우 콜라겐\\\" and black descriptive text specifying \\\"Korean Marine Collagen Peptides with Liposomal Glutathione, Vitamin C, Resveratrol and DigeZyme®,\\\" alongside \\\"Type I & III\\\" and a white horizontal banner highlighting \\\"Tropical Bliss Flavour.\\\" To the right of this frame sits a circular graphic featuring a pink-and-white geodesic, triangular grid pattern bordered by the curved text \\\"Wild Caught • Mercury Free,\\\" with a small red \\\"Clinically Approved\\\" cross seal above it. The bottom edge of the label displays five small black line-art skin-benefit icons lined up horizontally above text indicating a net weight of 250g. When the dry powder product inside is mixed with water as directed, it dissolves to form a vibrant, translucent coral-pink beverage.\\n\\nUse the product appearance text only as a private visual reference for accurately drawing the product. Do not print, quote, paraphrase, label, or turn any of that description into ad copy. Treat orientation-specific details carefully: show front-only details only when the product front is visible; if the brief shows the back, side, top, or an angled view where those details would not be visible, omit them instead of moving them onto the wrong face.\\n\\nThe attached product photos show the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"status\":\"generated\",\"createdBy\":\"f5dfb377-dac7-46a6-aea3-a4e04cb45e54\",\"metadata\":{\"brief\":\"Using the AIDA framework to drive top of funnel discovery, this static 1:1 ad focuses on the Desire and Identity archetype by showcasing the aspirational, radiant after-state of beauty. The visual hero is a bright, airy, high-end lifestyle photograph of a person with effortlessly luminous, glowing skin, basking in warm morning sunlight and holding a clear glass of the vibrant, translucent coral-pink collagen beverage next to the elegant matte-white Wellbeing Nutrition tub. The clean layout uses a soft Wellness Cream (#fff9eb) background to evoke a premium, natural morning ritual feel. The short, high-contrast on-image headline is set in elegant Tenor Sans typography and reads: 'Drink your morning glow.' A soft call to action button is styled as a sleek, black, sharp-cornered rectangle in the bottom corner reading 'Explore the collection.' Keep this creative on-brand by using the brand's signature soft pink (#FBE7F2) accents, a light grid overlay with an opacity of 0.1 for structural sophistication, and avoiding heavy text to let the aspirational, glowing skin imagery dominate.\",\"prompt\":\"Instructions by the director: Using the AIDA framework to drive top of 