but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"brandLogoUrl\":null,\"imageProvider\":\"openai\",\"productImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441847-2adc2ea9-c0cc-4150-be9b-5faab757b46b.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441997-2f98838e-1f9f-46de-becc-4cf2189a9988.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441988-f3064aac-97c7-4610-938a-4cc960c8d09d.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/32259477-b7f2-4895-aedd-cde326d7b380/1786868441892-f77f483a-80cb-4e77-a4e0-583c4fb73f17.jpg\"],\"visualDescription\":\"This dietary supplement product is packaged in a wide, cylindrical, matte-finish white plastic tub with a matching flat-topped, flush-fitting white screw cap. The wrap-around label features a smooth vertical color gradient, transitioning from solid white at the top to a warm, saturated coral-red at the bottom. Centered on the upper white section is a black circular logo containing the arched text \\\"WELLBEING NUTRITION\\\" surrounding a stylized central letter \\\"W\\\" with a single tiny green leaf on its top-right tip. Below the logo is a large, rectangular framed section in a deeper coral shade that houses the product name \\\"glow\\