n. The visual hero is a bold, split-screen graphic: the left side is a muted, desaturated Mist Gray (#f2f4f7) representing dull, lifeless skin texture, while the right side is a high-energy, vibrant coral-pink splash of the dissolved collagen drink next to the clean white 'glow' tub, representing instant revival. The high-impact on-image headline is written in clean, medium-weight Circular Std and reads: 'Tired of dull morning skin?' A pill-shaped accent tag at the top in Primary Brand Orange (#ff5000) highlights 'Korean Marine Collagen.' The soft call to action at the bottom reads 'See how it works.' Keep this creative on-brand by pairing the clinical Mist Gray with the vibrant action orange gradient, utilizing sharp miter-stroke icons to signal scientific validation, and ensuring the product packaging is shown clearly at the center of the color transition.\\n\\nProduct appearance: This dietary supplement product is packaged in a wide, cylindrical, matte-finish white plastic tub with a matching flat-topped, flush-fitting white screw cap. The wrap-around label features a smooth vertical color gradient, transitioning from solid white at the top to a warm, saturated coral-red at the bottom. Centered on the upper white section is a black circular logo containing the arched text \\\"WELLBEING NUTRITION\\\" surrounding a stylized central letter \\\"W\\\" with a single tiny green leaf on its top-right tip. Below the logo is a large, rectangular framed section in a deeper coral shade that houses the product name \\\"glow\\\" stacked above \\\"collagen^\\\" in a prominent, elegant white serif lowercase font, directly followed by black Korean characters \\\"글로우 콜라겐\\\" and black descriptive text specifying \\\"Korean Marine Collagen Peptides with Liposomal Glutathione, Vitamin C, Resveratrol and DigeZyme®,\\\" alongside \\\"Type I & III\\\" and a white horizontal banner highlighting \\\"Tropical Bliss Flavour.\\\" To the right of this frame sits a circular graphic featuring 